    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been trying this box breathing thing (inhale 4, hold 4, exhale 4, hold 4) to help with stress but i was wondering what's actually happening in the body when u do that? like how does it affect my nervous system or stuff like cortisol?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
